Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=2}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 50,0:01:32.67,0:01:36.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're still saying that?\NI'll crush you!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:36.92,0:01:38.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"King of the Pirates"?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:38.67,0:01:40.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't make laugh.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:49.85,0:01:51.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A new Haki.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:51.69,0:01:54.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Must be the technique\Nthat old man taught him.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:54.36,0:01:56.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,His punches can hurt Kaido.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:56.32,0:01:59.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But there's gotta be a trick.\NWhat the hell is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:59.24,0:02:03.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Killer laughs]\NWe might just win this!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:03.12,0:02:06.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's nice and all,\Nbut before I do anything,
Dialogue: 50,0:02:06.08,0:02:08.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,there's something I gotta\Nget straight with Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:08.75,0:02:11.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BIG MOM]\NHey, shrimp!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:12.17,0:02:13.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't even know\Nwhat it means
Dialogue: 50,0:02:13.42,0:02:14.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to be King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:14.92,0:02:17.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not something\Nyou take lightly!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:17.09,0:02:19.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So stop running your mouth!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:25.39,0:02:27.65,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[KAIDO]\NI kicked his ass in Kuri.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:27.65,0:02:30.57,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,How did he get so much stronger?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:30.57,0:02:33.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Luffy yells]
Dialogue: 50,0:02:33.44,0:02:36.02,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[KAIDO]\NFew can stand up to me,
Dialogue: 50,0:02:36.94,0:02:40.98,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,and they are not to\Nbe underestimated.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:46.70,0:02:50.16,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[KAIDO]\NI know you didn't\Ncome here just to lose.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:50.16,0:02:54.25,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you telling me you think\Nyou're as good as them?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:55.00,0:02:57.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Answer me, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:19.51,0:03:21.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,it!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:21.52,0:03:24.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I saw that one coming,\Nbut he's fast!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:24.81,0:03:26.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well done!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:26.23,0:03:29.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's an improvement over\Nlast time, if nothing else.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:29.27,0:03:31.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,C'mon, Kaido! Honestly?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:31.86,0:03:34.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Trash is meant\Nto be incinerated!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:34.90,0:03:36.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Prometheus!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:36.82,0:03:39.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, Mama?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:39.12,0:03:41.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll burn you to ash, boy!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:41.99,0:03:44.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[cackles]
Dialogue: 50,0:03:47.29,0:03:50.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Foxfire Style, Flame-Rend!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:53.17,0:03:55.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Prometheus screams]
Dialogue: 50,0:03:54.05,0:03:55.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Prometheus screams]
Dialogue: 50,0:03:55.47,0:03:58.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Big Mom gasps]\NHe cut Prometheus right in half!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:58.47,0:03:58.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[laughs]\NThat's Kin'emon's move!\NNice one, Zoro!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:58.58,0:03:59.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's
Dialogue: 50,0:04:00.88,0:04:03.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,move! Nice one, Zoro!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:05.10,0:04:06.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]\NI stole it.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:06.55,0:04:08.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]\NI stole it.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:09.81,0:04:11.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna make you pay!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:11.61,0:04:14.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NHuh? Don't lower\Nyour guard, Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:14.57,0:04:15.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Luffy gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:04:15.26,0:04:15.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NYou're dealing\Nwith two Emperors!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:15.78,0:04:18.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NYou're dealing\Nwith two Emperors!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:17.89,0:04:19.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Luffy gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:04:22.60,0:04:24.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[LAW]\NShambles.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:34.84,0:04:36.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat, get up.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:36.97,0:04:40.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NTraffy! Thanks! You saved me!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:42.43,0:04:44.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cuz there's something\Nyou and I need to get straight!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:44.23,0:04:45.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHuh?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:45.27,0:04:46.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those samurai.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:46.98,0:04:49.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was gonna teleport them\Nto safety anyway
Dialogue: 50,0:04:49.23,0:04:51.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,before you said\Na damn word to me!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:51.63,0:04:52.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:52.76,0:04:55.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,481)}[LAW]\NBut you just had to bark orders!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:55.09,0:04:58.34,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Traffy! Move them\Nall downstairs!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:00.60,0:05:02.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LAW]\NDo you know\Nhow that made me look?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:02.64,0:05:05.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Taking orders from you\Nlike a damn subordinate?!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:05.35,0:05:08.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Why would anyone\Ncare about that?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:09.51,0:05:11.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's the idea, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:11.77,0:05:15.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You followed Straw Hat's orders\Nto show your loyalty to him?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:15.64,0:05:17.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Of course not!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:17.81,0:05:20.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just a loser\Nwith a loser underling.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:20.02,0:05:22.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You two were\Nmade for each other.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:23.49,0:05:25.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're the loser,\Nyou big, stupid jerk!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:25.99,0:05:27.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KID]\NWas that directed at me?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:27.70,0:05:30.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can squabble on\Nyour own damn time!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:30.24,0:05:31.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[ALL]\N– Huh?!\N– Huh?!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:33.20,0:05:35.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Scorch 'em, Prometheus!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:35.12,0:05:36.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, Mama!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:36.79,0:05:38.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Heavenly Bon-Bons!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:38.84,0:05:40.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Prometheus grunts]
Dialogue: 50,0:05:43.13,0:05:45.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Kay, here's the deal!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:45.22,0:05:46.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Law, Kid growl]
Dialogue: 50,0:05:46.43,0:05:50.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The first person who\Ndodges her attack loses!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:50.22,0:05:52.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who would agree to that crap?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:52.14,0:05:53.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're a grown-ass man,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:53.22,0:05:55.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and you're still\Npulling this nonsense?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:55.35,0:05:57.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and die!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:57.15,0:05:59.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't have what it takes\Nto make it with real pirates!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:59.90,0:06:02.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fine, then!\NYou're losers and I win!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:02.78,0:06:04.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[LAW, KID]\N– Huh?\N– Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:04.57,0:06:06.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whatever. Suit yourselves.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:06.86,0:06:08.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LAW]\NI'm not playing.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:08.53,0:06:10.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But if you're not playing, then\Nwhy are you still standing here?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:10.58,0:06:12.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you wusses. Just go.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:12.58,0:06:13.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Law groans]
Dialogue: 50,0:06:15.04,0:06:17.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Watch out!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:26.21,0:06:28.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[all scream]
Dialogue: 50,0:06:28.25,0:06:30.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why did you all\Njust stand there?!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:30.13,0:06:34.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Big Mom laughs]\NWhat a pity!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:34.89,0:06:37.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So much for being\NKing of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:37.68,0:06:39.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, the fun part!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:39.72,0:06:43.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How am I gonna murder\Nyou rotten brats? Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:43.85,0:06:43.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gimme a sec, Linlin.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:43.93,0:06:45.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gimme a sec, Linlin.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:45.97,0:06:45.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wanna see how strong\Nthese kids are.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:45.98,0:06:48.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wanna see how strong\Nthese kids are.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:48.57,0:06:52.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm? That seems like\Na waste of time.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:52.61,0:06:54.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Killer cackles]
Dialogue: 50,0:06:54.06,0:06:56.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You stay back,\N"Hitokiri Kamazo."
Dialogue: 50,0:06:59.11,0:07:01.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You think that mask fooled me?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:01.15,0:07:03.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd know that laugh anywhere.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:03.36,0:07:05.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Killer laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:07:05.60,0:07:07.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Killer laughs]\NIf I'd had these Punishers
Dialogue: 50,0:07:07.05,0:07:08.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,with me when we fought,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:08.39,0:07:12.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you'd be dead, Zorojuro.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:09.28,0:07:12.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[Killer cackles]
Dialogue: 50,0:07:12.39,0:07:14.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I seriously doubt that.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:06.92,0:08:08.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not enough.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:11.76,0:08:14.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:08:16.34,0:08:18.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That wasn't half bad!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:18.22,0:08:21.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I need to unleash a little\Nmore of your power, Enma.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:21.35,0:08:22.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:22.85,0:08:23.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:08:23.23,0:08:23.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NKaido!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:23.54,0:08:24.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NKaido!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:26.50,0:08:26.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're gonna finish you\Nin one shot!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:26.56,0:08:29.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're gonna finish you\Nin one shot!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:54.92,0:10:59.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[yells]
Dialogue: 50,0:10:54.97,0:11:00.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[cackles]
Dialogue: 50,0:10:59.92,0:11:04.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[cackles]
Dialogue: 50,0:11:06.19,0:11:06.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Each of you a monster\Nin your own right.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:06.43,0:11:08.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KAIDO]\NEach of you a monster\Nin your own right.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:08.97,0:11:09.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just as it should be!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:09.03,0:11:10.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As it should be!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:10.81,0:11:13.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KAIDO]\NLet's see if you\Nhave what it takes
Dialogue: 50,0:11:13.35,0:11:15.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to be King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:15.60,0:11:17.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't hold back!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:17.40,0:11:20.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[yells]
Dialogue: 50,0:11:17.44,0:11:18.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[groans]
Dialogue: 50,0:11:18.65,0:11:19.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Kid growls]
Dialogue: 50,0:11:34.00,0:11:38.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[Luffy grunts]
Dialogue: 50,0:11:38.88,0:11:40.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Kaido groans]
Dialogue: 50,0:11:47.60,0:11:51.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[sighs]\NThat stung.\NNot a bad start!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:51.97,0:11:55.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Kid grunts]\NI probably couldn't
Dialogue: 50,0:11:55.14,0:11:57.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,break through your\Nthick skin if I tried!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:57.23,0:11:58.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But that doesn't mean I can't
Dialogue: 50,0:11:58.94,0:12:02.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,crush you to death\Nwith enough pressure!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:06.91,0:12:07.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You wanna see me at my worst?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:07.20,0:12:08.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You wanna see me at my worst?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:08.62,0:12:08.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm happy to give you\Na front row seat!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:08.95,0:12:11.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm happy to give you\Na front row seat!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:16.92,0:12:20.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Kid grunting]
Dialogue: 50,0:12:30.05,0:12:33.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Kaido sighs]\NThat's not bad.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:33.10,0:12:36.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But it needs more mass\Nto seal the deal.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:36.39,0:12:38.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Kid grunts]
Dialogue: 50,0:12:42.94,0:12:45.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LAW]\NMore mass? Let's try this, then!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:45.82,0:12:46.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:46.82,0:12:48.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Now, Takt!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:50.28,0:12:51.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:02.88,0:13:04.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:04.38,0:13:07.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You were gonna take me out,\Ntoo, weren't you?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:07.90,0:13:13.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Kaido chuckles]\NDamn, that hurt.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:13.32,0:13:15.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're really trying to bury me.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:16.41,0:13:17.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Luffy grunts]
Dialogue: 50,0:13:17.99,0:13:19.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KAIDO]\NI remember that feeling.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:29.54,0:13:32.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KAIDO]\NReminds me of\Nthe good old days.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:33.34,0:13:36.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[cackles]
Dialogue: 50,0:13:37.76,0:13:39.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yummy yum!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:39.30,0:13:42.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All charged and ready to go!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:42.02,0:13:44.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[cackles]
Dialogue: 50,0:13:44.10,0:13:46.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Big Mom cackles]
Dialogue: 50,0:13:48.90,0:13:51.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here I thought\Nyou were all talk!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:51.02,0:13:52.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That wasn't half bad!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:52.74,0:13:53.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KAIDO]\NIf you're crazy enough\Nto aim for King of the Pirates,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:53.00,0:13:55.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KAIDO]\NIf you're crazy enough\Nto aim for King of the Pirates,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:55.74,0:13:56.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that's the least I can expect.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:56.13,0:13:58.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that's the least I can expect.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:59.36,0:14:01.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Kaido cackles]
Dialogue: 50,0:14:01.49,0:14:01.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KAIDO]\NAnd yet, none of you\Nhave any hope of stopping me.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:01.65,0:14:06.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And yet none of you have\Nany hope of stopping me!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:19.22,0:14:21.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KAIDO]\NAlmost breaks my heart.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:21.56,0:14:23.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've come this far,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:23.35,0:14:26.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but you'll all be dead\Nin no time at all.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:27.69,0:14:30.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Kaido cackles]
Dialogue: 50,0:14:35.82,0:14:39.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KAIDO]\NAnd I'll take so much\Nmore than just your life.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:39.78,0:14:42.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like any good pirate,\NI'll take all your crew members
Dialogue: 50,0:14:42.87,0:14:44.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,who followed you here.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:47.12,0:14:49.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way in hell.\NI'll never let you!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:52.29,0:14:54.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[cackles]\NNot just\Nyour crew members.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:54.59,0:14:56.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll take all of\Nyour treasures, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:56.72,0:14:59.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've got some\NPoneglyphs, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:59.01,0:15:01.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A fair prize for\Nwhat you put me through!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:01.89,0:15:04.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:05.52,0:15:07.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Didn't think about treasure!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:07.14,0:15:09.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd be happy to take yours!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:12.56,0:15:16.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KAIDO]\NWhoever wins this battle\Nwill be one step closer
Dialogue: 50,0:15:16.32,0:15:18.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to being King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:20.20,0:15:22.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right about that.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:22.53,0:15:24.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And it's gonna be me!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:16.26,0:16:18.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They were just scraps, anyway!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:22.35,0:16:24.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KILLER]\NKaido!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:26.40,0:16:28.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Kaido cackles]
Dialogue: 50,0:16:30.15,0:16:33.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KAIDO]\NYou idiots will never\Nbe King of the Pirates,
Dialogue: 50,0:16:33.36,0:16:36.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but at least you can\Nentertain me before you die.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:42.73,0:16:45.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KAIDO]\NThe Land of Wano is mine!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:45.03,0:16:48.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I will bring a new era!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:51.32,0:16:51.51,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,[KINE'MON]\NCan you carry\Nthe weight for me?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:51.51,0:16:54.18,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,[KINE'MON]\NCan you carry\Nthe weight for me?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:55.68,0:16:56.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Will you deliver this country?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:56.04,0:16:58.58,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Will you deliver this country?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:04.34,0:17:05.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[exhales]
Dialogue: 50,0:17:16.64,0:17:19.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Wano doesn't belong to you!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:20.06,0:17:25.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum-Gum Kong Rifle!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:26.90,0:17:28.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Kaido groans]
Dialogue: 50,0:17:28.53,0:17:32.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[yells]
Dialogue: 50,0:17:37.83,0:17:40.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Takin' a nap, Mister Emperor?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:40.21,0:17:42.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then this is your wake-up call!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:46.71,0:17:51.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[yells]
Dialogue: 50,0:17:54.47,0:17:59.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[KID]\NSlam Gibson!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:10.53,0:18:14.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Now, Room! And Shambles!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:20.54,0:18:23.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Never seen an anatomical\Nchart of a dragon before.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:29.88,0:18:33.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But your heart should be here!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:34.10,0:18:35.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[LAW]\NGamma Knife!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:38.02,0:18:42.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Kaido groans]
Dialogue: 50,0:18:43.19,0:18:44.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If I can't beat you\Nfrom the outside,
Dialogue: 50,0:18:44.90,0:18:46.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll do it from within!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:48.17,0:18:49.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:18:49.42,0:18:55.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Kaido groans]\NYou're quite the pest!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:02.81,0:19:05.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Kaido panting]\NSeems you've done your research.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:05.04,0:19:07.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you know how durable I am,
Dialogue: 50,0:19:07.50,0:19:10.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,maybe you're not as stupid\Nas I thought you were.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:13.01,0:19:16.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KILLER]\NThose scales of yours\Nare a real pain in the ass.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:17.06,0:19:20.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I know a trick\Nto get inside, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:26.36,0:19:30.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[KILLER]\NScyther!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:30.57,0:19:32.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[KILLER]\NSonic!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:38.83,0:19:43.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Kaido screaming]
Dialogue: 50,0:19:43.46,0:19:49.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KILLER]\NThat one hurt,\Ndidn't it? Now die!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:49.29,0:19:50.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Indra!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:51.92,0:19:54.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Killer gasps, groans]
Dialogue: 50,0:19:56.01,0:20:00.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[cackles]
Dialogue: 50,0:19:58.22,0:20:00.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Big Mom cackles]
Dialogue: 50,0:20:00.93,0:20:04.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As long as you're under\Nthe open sky, you're my prey!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:04.52,0:20:07.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You didn't think you could\Nescape from me, did you?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:08.62,0:20:13.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KAIDO]\NI admit, my expectations\Nweren't exactly high,
Dialogue: 50,0:20:13.05,0:20:14.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but this has been fun!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:14.72,0:20:17.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Rhino Schneider!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:17.59,0:20:20.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Kaido groans]
Dialogue: 50,0:20:17.99,0:20:23.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Luffy grunts]
Dialogue: 50,0:20:23.79,0:20:27.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KAIDO]\NLook at you! Not bad!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:33.92,0:20:37.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Traffy!\NTeleport me up there, and hurry!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:38.16,0:20:40.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? I'm not a moving service!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:40.18,0:20:42.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I don't take\Norders from you!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:43.85,0:20:45.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll do it 'cause I want to!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:45.52,0:20:48.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not because you told me to!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:48.11,0:20:50.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Foxfire Style.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:50.40,0:20:55.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)}[Law growls]
Dialogue: 50,0:20:55.49,0:20:58.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[KAIDO]\NBlast Breath!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:04.87,0:21:06.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Flame-Rend!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:12.88,0:21:14.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Zoro!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:15.64,0:21:17.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's try again!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:17.14,0:21:18.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 50,0:21:18.55,0:21:20.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NTraffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:20.43,0:21:22.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha? I told you.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:22.60,0:21:25.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop acting like you're\Nmy boss, damn it!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:28.10,0:21:29.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KAIDO]\NHuh?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:31.44,0:21:32.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:21:32.74,0:21:34.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KAIDO]\NWhat the hell?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:34.78,0:21:38.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BIG MOM]\NHm? Out of the way, Kaido!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:38.03,0:21:41.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's no ordinary\Nweapon he's got!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:41.74,0:21:44.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}One-Sword Style!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:53.92,0:21:56.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,150)}[ZORO]\NFlying Dragon Blaze!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:07.94,0:22:10.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KAIDO]\NWhat is this power I feel?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:10.69,0:22:12.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why is Oden's presence\Nin his sword?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:12.86,0:22:15.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn it. I missed!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:15.72,0:22:18.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is what you get\Nfor taking us lightly.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:18.76,0:22:20.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Indra!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:22.22,0:22:26.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:22:26.40,0:22:28.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No. Zoro!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:32.40,0:22:35.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BIG MOM]\NLook at that.\NAll lined up for me!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:37.53,0:22:42.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,150)}God of Lightning Tenjin,\Nheed my call!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:44.70,0:22:47.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:22:47.04,0:22:48.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Zeus cackles]
Dialogue: 50,0:22:48.33,0:22:51.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That woman is a living calamity!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:52.46,0:22:55.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(732.5,1053)}- [Zeus cackles]\N- [Kid gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:22:55.67,0:22:57.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[groans]
Dialogue: 50,0:22:57.22,0:23:04.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Big Mom cackling]
Dialogue: 50,0:23:18.91,0:23:24.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Big Mom cackles]
Dialogue: 50,0:23:25.41,0:23:26.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BIG MOM]\NHm? What in the hell?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:26.71,0:23:28.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What in the hell?!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:28.42,0:23:28.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How did you survive\Nall that lightning
Dialogue: 50,0:23:28.42,0:23:30.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How did you survive\Nall that lightning
Dialogue: 50,0:23:30.13,0:23:30.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,without a scratch on you?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:30.21,0:23:32.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,without a scratch on you?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:38.76,0:23:38.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Cause I'm a rubber man!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:38.80,0:23:41.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Cause I'm a rubber man!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:43.39,0:23:45.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:23:43.60,0:23:45.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:23:45.35,0:23:45.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're gonna pay for\Nhurting my friends!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:45.48,0:23:48.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're gonna pay for\Nhurting my friends!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:51.06,0:23:52.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[KAIDO]\NBlast
Dialogue: 50,0:24:23.60,0:24:23.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KAIDO]\NFire doesn't\Nwork either. Why not?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:23.73,0:24:25.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KAIDO]\NFire doesn't work either.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:25.56,0:24:27.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why the hell not?
